# Send Docker only what the build needs: the module files and the program's
# source. Everything else stays out of the build context, above all cache/
# (the generated dataset, gigabytes), and also bin/, the evmgraph binary built
# for macOS, bench/ (and its results), .task/, docs/ and tests/ (the container
# tests' own module). Listing what goes in, rather than what stays out, means
# a new folder is left out until it is needed.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Tests are not part of the program: leaving them out means editing a test
# does not rebuild the image.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
